// The behavioural half of the `orders` project. `for Order` and every
// `writes` / `reads` effect reaches across a GRAMMAR boundary into
// `orders.domain`, resolved through the same shared index the LSP head serves.
//
// `writes Order.status = PAID` is the seam this example exists for: three
// references, each scoped by the previous one. `status` is only offered
// because `Order` resolved, and `PAID` is only offered because `status` is
// typed `OrderStatus`. Rename `OrderStatus.PAID` in `.domain` and this file
// follows; delete the field and the effect reports at a precise range.

process Fulfillment for Order {
   task Pay writes Order.status = PAID
   gateway PaymentOk
      yes -> Pick
      no -> Cancel
   task Pick reads Order.id
   task Ship writes Order.status = SHIPPED
   task Cancel writes Order.status = CANCELLED
   transition Pay -> PaymentOk
   transition Pick -> Ship
}
